- ### Splitting
+ ### Partage

- `share` divides an amount into a number of parts which sum exactly to the whole. Any remainder
- is distributed one minor unit at a time. This is the allocation problem which naive division
- gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
+ `share` divise un montant en un nombre de parts dont la somme est exactement le tout. Tout
+ reste est distribué une unité mineure à la fois. C'est le problème de répartition que la
+ division naïve résout mal : trois parts égales de 3,01 € perdraient un centime.

= gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
=
= ```scala fuel
- run
+ run

= gets wrong: three equal shares of €3.01 would lose a cent.
=
