- ### Identifiers
+ ### Identifiants

- The identifying numbers of finance are checked here too. An
- [ISIN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Securities_Identification_Number) is the
- international identifier of a security. The `isin"…"` [interpolator] validates one at
- [compiletime], including its checksum, and `Isin(…)` does the same at runtime:
+ Les numéros d'identification de la finance sont eux aussi vérifiés ici. Un
+ [ISIN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Securities_Identification_Number) est
+ l'identifiant international d'un titre. L'[interpolateur] `isin"…"` en valide un
+ [à la compilation][compilation], somme de contrôle comprise, et `Isin(…)` fait de même à
+ l'exécution :

= [compiletime], including its checksum, and `Isin(…)` does the same at runtime:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"
+ val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"

= val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"
